  "description": "2dog command-line tool and project templates. `dnx 2dog` interactively creates a Godot project with .NET hosts, or adds hosts (desktop, browser-wasm, xUnit) to an existing one; every prompt has a flag, so `2dog new MyGame --desktop --tests` runs unattended. `dotnet new install 2dog` provides the `dotnet new 2dog` project template. The engine library itself is the 2dog.engine package.",
